## Week 32: ACT Exam Week

### Before the Exam

- confirm test-day logistics (location, time, required materials);
- brief, low-stakes confidence-building review, not new content;
- calculator and materials check;
- test-day routine and stress-management strategies.

### Test Administration

Students take the official spring ACT.

### After the Exam

- brief reflection: what felt manageable, what felt difficult;
- no new academic instruction is introduced this week;
- remaining time supports Study Hall, coursework, or early postsecondary work.

> **Calendar Note:** The official spring ACT date is not finalized as of this writing but typically falls between April 10 and April 17. This week's placement should be confirmed once the exact date is set, and Weeks 30-31 shifted earlier or later as needed so students go into test day with review time, not new instruction, in the days immediately before.

